  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Research Into Factors Contributing to Violent and Peaceful Behaviours in Cross Border Conflict Evidence and Policy Trends.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Looks at how conflict traumas affect mental health and pathways to violent/peaceful decision-making over time. Includes large-scale longitudinal surveys in Iraq, Syria, and South Sudan. The research team is interdisciplinary with experts in trauma, radicalization, neuroscience and conflict</narrative>
  </description>
